 \"Sydney Taivavashe\",\n    \"type\": \"movie\",\n    \"genre\": \"Action\",\n    \"year\": 2020,\n    \"duration\": \"1h 50m\",\n    \"description\": \"A compelling Zimbabwean anti-poaching action drama stream highlighting wildlife preservation, community resilience, and courage in Gonarezhou National Park.\",\n    \"cover_image\": \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516426122078-c23e76319801?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80\",\n    \"media_url\": \"/media/streamwave-preview.mp4\",\n    \"preview_url\": \"/media/streamwave-preview.mp4\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"4\",\n    \"title\": \"Shaina\",\n    \"artist_or_director\": \"Beatrice Masvaure Nyamupinga\",\n    \"type\": \"movie\",\n    \"genre\": \"Drama\",\n    \"year\": 2020,\n    \"duration\": \"1h 38m\",\n    \"description\": \"An inspiring story of young Zimbabwean women overcoming hardship through friendship, innovation, and determination.\",\n    \"cover_image\": \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1536440136628-849c177e76a1?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80\",\n    \"media_url\": \"/media/streamwave-preview.mp4\",\n    \"preview_url\": \"/media/streamwave-preview.mp4\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"5\",\n    \"title\": \"Disappear\",\n    \"artist_or_director\": \"Winky D\",\n    \"type\": \"music\",\n    \"genre\": \"Zimdancehall\",\n    \"year\": 2015,\n    \"duration\": \"3m 45s\",\n    \"description\": \"An iconic Zimdancehall anthem by pioneer Winky D, celebrating resilience, joy, and hope. Available for streaming on StreamWave Music.\",\n    \"cover_image\": \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511671782779-c97d3d27a1d4?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80\",\n    \"media_url\": \"/media/demo.wav\",\n    \"preview_url\": null\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"6\",\n    \"title\": \"Mudhara Vachida\",\n    \"artist_or_director\": \"Jah Prayzah\",\n    \"type\": \"music\",\n    \"genre\": \"Afro-pop\",\n    \"year\": 2016,\n    \"duration\": \"4m 12s\",\n    \"description\": \"A high-energy Afro-fusion hit stream blending contemporary rhythms with traditional Zimbabwean mbira textures.\",\n    \"cover_image\": \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1470225620780-dba8ba36b745?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80\",\n    \"media_url\": \"/media/demo.wav\",\n    \"preview_url\": null\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"7\",\n    \"title\": \"Mbira Magic (Live in Harare)\",\n    \"artist_or_director\": \"Stella Chiweshe\",\n    \"type\": \"music\",\n    \"genre\": \"Traditional\",\n    \"year\": 1998,\n    \"duration\": \"5m 30s\",\n    \"description\": \"Spellbinding traditional Mbira performance by the Queen of Mbira, reflecting deep ancestral roots and cultural heritage.\",\n    \"cover_image\": \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1514525253161-7a46d19cd819?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80\",\n    \"media_url\": \"/media/demo.wav\",\n    \"preview_url\": null\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"8\",\n    \"title\": \"Akiliz\",\n    \"artist_or_director\": \"Ammara Brown\",\n    \"type\": \"music\",\n    \"genre\": \"Afro-pop\",\n    \"year\": 2017,\n    \"duration\": \"3m 38s\",\n    \"description\": \"A chart-topping Zimbabwean Afro-pop stream featuring emotive storytelling and vibrant synth-pop production.\",\n    \"cover_image\": \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1493225457124-a3eb161ffa5f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80\",\n    \"media_url\": \"/media/demo.wav\",\n    \"preview_url\": null\n  }\n]\n","Description":"Update data/media.json with preview_url pointing to /media/streamwave-preview.mp4 for movies","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\dell\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457\\data\\media.json","toolAction":"Updating data/media.json with movie preview URLs","toolSummary":"Updating data/media.json with movie preview URLs"}}]}
